{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":5,"ref":"2-samuel 13:5","book":"2-samuel","lang":"yo","chapter":13,"translation":"Yehonadab sọ fún un pé: “Gbé lé orùn rẹ, fi ara rẹ hàn gẹ́gẹ́ bí aláìsàn; nígbà tí baba rẹ bá wá láti kí ọ, sọ fún un pé: ‘Jọ̀wọ́, kí Tamar arábìnrin mi wá, kí ó sì fún mi ní oúnjẹ, kí ó sì ṣe ⟨את⟩ oúnjẹ náà níwájú ojú mi, nítorí pé kí n lè rí i, kí n sì lè jẹ lọ́wọ́ rẹ̀.’”","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"ó sọ"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"fún un"},{"surface":"יהונדב","gloss":"Yehonadab"},{"surface":"שכב","gloss":"gbé lé"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"lé"},{"surface":"משכבך","gloss":"orùn rẹ"},{"surface":"והתחל","gloss":"fi ara rẹ hàn gẹ́gẹ́ bí aláìsàn"},{"surface":"ובא","gloss":"kí ó wá"},{"surface":"אביך","gloss":"baba rẹ"},{"surface":"לראותך","gloss":"láti kí ọ"},{"surface":"ואמרת","gloss":"ìwọ sọ"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"fún un"},{"surface":"תבא","gloss":"kí ó wá"},{"surface":"נא","gloss":"jọ̀wọ́"},{"surface":"תמר","gloss":"Tamar"},{"surface":"אחותי","gloss":"arábìnrin mi"},{"surface":"ותברני","gloss":"kí ó fún mi"},{"surface":"לחם","gloss":"ní oúnjẹ"},{"surface":"ועשתה","gloss":"kí ó sì ṣe"},{"surface":"לעיני","gloss":"níwájú ojú mi"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"oúnjẹ náà"},{"surface":"הבריה","gloss":"oúnjẹ náà"},{"surface":"למען","gloss":"nítorí"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"pé"},{"surface":"אראה","gloss":"kí n lè rí i"},{"surface":"ואכלתי","gloss":"kí n sì lè jẹ"},{"surface":"מידה","gloss":"lọ́wọ́ rẹ̀"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-23T01:02:20.283188451Z","model":"glm-5.3"}